      "message": "It looks a bit strange to be starting NetworkMonitor even though the network basically doesn\u0027t exist yet (since the NetworkAgentInfo is not inserted in the hash tables). At the moment I think it\u0027s fine because NetworkMonitor doesn\u0027t actually do anything until it gets CMD_NETWORK_CONNECTED, but still.",
