      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-25T09:48:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s a bit dangerous to insert the agent into the map before the capabilities are adequately processed and restricted, but getAndSet skips the setting if the monitor is not started.\n\nI\u0027m pretty sure it\u0027s safe exactly for the reason you mention : creating the NM doesn\u0027t actually do anything besides making it ready to accept the CONNECTED command.",
      "parentUuid": "73b736c1_6bbe23d7",
